# T-152-016 Execution Plan: ADR 43 Compliance Automated Scan

## Goal
Produce a comprehensive ADR compliance audit at docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-016-adr-compliance.md.
READ-ONLY: no source code changes.

## Approach
1. Load ADR index from .brain/exports/decisions.md and summary.md (43 ADRs)
2. For each ADR, scan codebase for enforcement evidence:
   - ADR-001 TypeScript+ESM → package.json "type":"module", tsconfig.json module:NodeNext
   - ADR-002 Node16 Module Resolution → tsconfig moduleResolution
   - ADR-003 vitest over Jest → package.json deps
   - ADR-004 3-Layer Config Merge → src/core/config.ts
   - ADR-005 Synchronous I/O → DEPRECATED — check remaining sync callsites
   - ADR-006 spawnSync Security Pattern → execSync leakage grep
   - ADR-007 SpawnOptions Interface → core types
   - ADR-008 Brain Merkezi Import → circular dep scan
   - ADR-009 DEBT.md Markdown Table → debt format
   - ADR-010 Tek Runtime Dep commander.js → package.json deps scan
   - ADR-011 node:readline/promises → 3rd party prompt leakage
   - ADR-012 register<Name>(program) → cli register pattern
   - ADR-013 DECKENT.md Adapter Pattern → presence
   - ADR-014 .deck Secret File → .deck handler
   - ADR-015 TaskRouter Module → task-router.ts
   - ADR-016 Connector Module → provider lifecycle
   - ADR-017 MCP-Native Provider Adapters → mcp/providers
   - ADR-018 Multi-Env Config Generation → config generators
   - ADR-019 Language-Agnostic Worker Verify → worker verify
   - ADR-020 Rich Sprint Output → sprint-reporter sections
   - ADR-021 Kraken ASCII Brand → kraken ascii
   - ADR-022 CLI/MCP Parity (superseded)
   - ADR-022-v2 Parity + Missing Cmds
   - ADR-023 Plan Tier Generalization → tier names
   - ADR-024 sprint-controller God Split → LoC check
   - ADR-025 Graceful Shutdown → SIGINT handler
   - ADR-026 God Object Split Phase 1-3
   - ADR-027 Hybrid Spawn Backend → spawn-backend.ts
   - ADR-028 Decision-Engine V1→V2 Routing → routing-engine.ts
   - ADR-029 Managed-Docs Universalization → managed-docs module
   - ADR-030 Template Engine + Plugin Loader
   - ADR-031 Content Hash Cache
   - ADR-032 i18n Pattern System → TR/EN patterns
   - ADR-033 Product Not Service
   - ADR-034 Multi-Project Isolation
   - ADR-035 Verification Protocol 15 channels → verify code
   - ADR-036 ADR Governance Integration → scripts/adr-validator.mjs + worker prompt inject
   - ADR-037 Brain-Auditor-Worker RBAC V1.0 → runtime RBAC enforcement
   - ADR-038 Dead Code Disposition
   - ADR-039 Self-Modifying Task Detection → self-modifying-detector.ts
   - ADR-040 Nervous System Architecture → src/nervous/
   - ADR-041 Agent Taxonomy Horizontal/Vertical
   - ADR-042 Hybrid Mode Architecture (proposed)

3. Build compliance table: ADR | Status | Evidence | Drift
4. Write drift alarm list (P0/P1/P2)
5. Write Sprint 153 action items

## Commands (read-only)
- grep for spawnSync/execSync
- read package.json, tsconfig.json
- list src/core/ src/cli/ src/mcp/ src/nervous/ src/orchestra/
- stat on key files (self-modifying-detector.ts, task-router.ts)
- grep for "readline-sync" / "inquirer" / "prompts" pkgs

## Output
docs/audits/sprint-152/T-152-016-adr-compliance.md with:
- Executive summary
- 43 ADR compliance table
- Drift alarm list
- Sprint 153+ action items
